            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fresco 0.3.1</h2>
<pre>
Fresco 0.3.1 — two fixes.

- Each source remembers its category: switch from Wallhaven to another
  source and back, and your category is still selected instead of
  resetting to Featured
- Back keeps working after Set: applying a previewed wallpaper no
  longer clears the ones you looked at before it
</pre>
]]></description>
