            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fresco 0.1.1</h2>
<pre>
Fresco 0.1.1 — installable with Homebrew.

No changes to the app itself. Fresco can now be installed with:

    brew install --cask danielyan/tap/fresco

Every release keeps that install current, and copies you already have
keep updating themselves from the menu bar, as before.
</pre>
]]></description>
